# SECTION 1 - DUSK   b1-14   (0:00 - 0:59)
# Held B-minor chord (violins II + violas div., basses; no mutes exist in the
# patches, so the hush is in the dynamics and the empty middle).  The solo
# cello enters alone, low on the C string, quasi parlando, with the Song's head
# (F#-B-D) as speech.  Harmony: i - iv6 - viio7/V - V7 - i - VI7 - iv9 - V7 - i.
# b13-14 start the Song's accompaniment (figure + heartbeat).

# -- b1-2: the held chord alone (B minor, 6 notes, no celli).  It breathes out.
# -- b3: the solo cello alone, low, almost speaking: F#-B-D, the head of the Song
# -- upside-down in time, in the dark of the C and G strings.
# -- b4-8: the strings return under it: Em/G - C#dim7 - F#7 - Bm.
== b1-8 [Dusk] ==
@ T=56 M=4/4 K=bm "Lento, notturno"
@@ b1 T=56
vcs:   | R | {ks:Sus NV VB VB Solo} 2 r 4. {p}{"quasi parlando"} f#2_ 8 b2_ | 2 d3_ 8 d3 c#3 4 b2_ | 4 r 8 [g2 f#2] 4. e2_ 8 d2 | 2. c#2_ 4 r | {ks:Legato Slur} 4 r 8 {<} [c#2 f#2 4 a#2 c#3 | 2 {mp} e3 {>} 8 d3 c#3 b2 a#2] | 2. {p} b2 4 r |
vn2:   | {ks:Sus MAX} 1 {pp}{div}{<} (b3 f#4)~ | 2 {>} (b3 f#4) 2 r | R | 1 {pp} (b3 e4) | 1 (b3 e4) | 1 (c#4 e4)~ | 1 (c#4 e4) | 1 (d4 f#4) |
va:    | {ks:Sus MAX} 1 {pp}{div}{<} (f#3 d4)~ | 2 {>} (f#3 d4) 2 r | R | 1 {pp} (e3 g3) | 1 (e3 g3) | 1 (e3 a#3)~ | 1 (e3 a#3) | 1 (f#3 b3) |
cb:    | {ks:Sus MAX} 1 {pp}{<} b1~ | 2 {>} b1 2 r | R | 1 {pp} g1 | 1 c#2 | 1 f#1~ | 1 f#1 | 1 b1 |

# -- b9-12: the cello climbs out of the dark, across G, D and A strings, to its
# -- first C#4 over F#7, and settles on B3.
# -- b13-14: the night begins to move: the celli section's nocturne figure and the
# -- basses' slow heartbeat (beats 1 and 3).
== b9-14 ==
@ T=56 M=4/4 K=bm
@@ b9 T=56
@@ b12 T=52 "poco rit."
@@ b13 T=64 "Andante sostenuto"
vcs:   | {ks:Legato Slur} 4 r 8 {mp} [b2 d3 4. f#3 8 e3 | 8 {<} d3 e3 f#3 g3 4 a3 b3 | 2 {mf} c#4 {>} 4 b3 a#3 | 1 {p} b3] | R | R |
vn2:   | {ks:Sus MAX} 1 {pp}{div} (d4 f#4)~ | 1 (d4 f#4) | 1 (e4 a#4) | 1 {>} (d4 b4) | R | R |
va:    | {ks:Sus MAX} 1 {pp}{div} (g3 b3)~ | 1 (g3 b3) | 1 (f#3 c#4) | 1 {>} (f#3 b3) | R | R |
vc:    | R*4 | {ks:Leg Slur MAX} {pp}{"dolce, sempre legato"} 8 [b2 f#3 b3 d4 b3 f#3 b3 f#3] | 8 [b2 b3 f#3 d4 b3 f#3 d4 f#3] |
cb:    | {ks:Sus MAX} 1 {pp} g1 | 1 e1 | 1 f#1 | 1 b1 | {ks:Stac On Bow RRx9} {p}4 b1' r b1' r | 4 b1' r b1' r |

HANDOFF:
Bar 14 ends on B minor, T=64.  The celli section is in its eighth-note figure
(Leg Slur MAX, pp), basses beat the slow heartbeat (Stac On Bow, beats 1/3, p).
Violins and violas rest.  Song (b15) starts with the solo cello's tune, high
on the A string, on the downbeat.
